<title>USA: Lockheed gets $342 mln US defense contract.</title>
<headline>Lockheed gets $342 mln US defense contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lockheed Martin Corp has received a modified $342 million U.S. defense contract for work on Aegis anti-aircraft weapons systems for guided missile destroyers, the Navy said.</p>
</text>
